		<defName>CGF1_MWP_Type53_Mosin_BSTG_</defName>
		<label>Type 53 Mosin BSTG</label>
		<description>Caliber: 7.62x39mm. 1-round internal mag. Bolt-Action.
		
The Type 53 BSTG, known by western collectors as the "Type 53 Initial Bullet Speed Trial Gun," is a conversion of the Chinese Type 53 Mosin to a single-shot 7.62x39mm rifle. As its name suggests, it was used to test the newly adopted 7.62x39mm cartridge. Only a single digit number of the rifles are known to have ever been produced, making them extremely rare.</description>
